    {
     "t": "Track misfire after supercharger cooling service",
     "kind": "Maker bulletin",
     "rx": "misfire|p0300|intercooler|charge air cooler|heat soak",
     "x": "In high heat above 100 mph on a track, the engine can misfire (code P0300) if air was left in the supercharger cooling loop after a repair.",
     "fix": "Dealer drains and vacuum-fills the loop with GM's tools (bulletin 17-NA-408).",
     "src": [
      "tsb408"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "10-speed automatic recall (transmission)",
     "kind": "Recall",
     "rx": "harsh (shift|downshift)|transmission (slam|lock)|wheels? lock|10.?speed",
     "x": "On 2020–2022 Camaros with the 10-speed, valve body wear can cause harsh downshifts and, rarely, a brief wheel lock-up.",
